BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association
UID:event_315573429@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260720T040522Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260801T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260801T150000
SUMMARY:Knobstone Adopters Work Day
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\n**KHTA V
 olunteers & Adopters Workday – August 1 - 9 am to 3 pm**\nWe have made c
 onsiderable progress since the beginning of the year\, clearing trail\, bu
 ilding drains\, and chainsawing blowdowns from mile 35 to 38. We will cont
 inue maintenance of the trail between Hwy 56 and Banes Hollow Road.\nDetai
 ls will be posted here\, on Meetup\, and Facebook. We will meet at the Oxl
 ey Memorial Trialhead.\nFor Google directions\, click on [Oxley Memorial T
 rHd.](https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=1u2N0UcaZxTfObaD1HNvNKkU4XtqP
 nL4&usp=sharing)\nPlease bring a lunch and water. We will have large hand 
 tools\, you may bring any small tools you have such as clippers or a pruni
 ng saw. And a backpack is handy to carry everything in. Instructions will 
 be provided for those who need them. We will finish at about 3:00 pm.\n\nJ
 oin us on our website at [http://www.knobstonehikingtrail.org/](http://www
 .knobstonehikingtrail.org/) and on Facebook at [KHTA Facebook Group.](http
 s://www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of
 -indiana-meetup/events/315573429/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260706T162150Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260706T162150Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association
UID:event_315747472@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260720T040522Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T151500
SUMMARY:2nd Weekend Work Day Trail Building
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\nWould yo
 u like to spend a day in some beautiful woods with a delightful group of p
 eople building a connecting section of Indiana’s premier long distance h
 iking trail? Come join us as we continue work on the Tecumseh Trail extens
 ion portion of the KHT in MMSF. We will be building the new trail includin
 g clipping green briar.\nPlease bring a lunch and water. We will have larg
 e hand tools\, but please bring any small tools you have such as clippers 
 or a pruning saw. And a backpack is handy to carry everything in. Instruct
 ions will be provided for those who need them. We finish about 3:30.\nMeet
  at the Hatfield Ridge Road gate. The gate is locked but we have a key. Go
  to the big sign on Rosenbaum/Catholic Cemetery Rd.\nJoin us on our websit
 e at http://www.knobstonehikingtrail.org/\, on Facebook at [www.facebook.c
 om/groups/2255586117953484](http://www.facebook.com/groups/225558611795348
 4)\, and Substack [https://khta.substack.com/](https://khta.substack.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of
 -indiana-meetup/events/315747472/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260719T132846Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260719T132846Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
